    "text": "utpbfalcons.com\nwebsite\nOdessa\nWomen’s golf takes third in season opener\nBy Ricky Baptist, Sports Information Director,\n1 days agoLAWTON, Okla. (September 16, 2025) – The 2025-26 season for The University of Texas Permian Basin women's golf team is underway as the Falcons competed at the Oklahoma Women's Intercollegiate hosted by Cameron University on Monday and Tuesday. With three freshmen and two sophomores in the lineup, the Falcons got their year off to a great start with a third-place finish.",
